!Name: ships-c4d-connect
!C [Editor's note: This file is silly, and should probably be removed.]
!C
!C To make a c/4 diagonal spaceship, connect a front end from the
!C top section to a back end from the bottom section (by overlapping the
!C zigzag-shaped section). Not every combination works, but most do.
!C 1.1 and 2.1 found by Hartmut Holzwart
!C All others found by Jason Summers
!C [version: 1999.6.22]
!Source: jslife-moving
